{"bookId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV", "title": "The Long Goodbye", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1692713804, "updated": [{"bookId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV", "bookmarkId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV_53_7871-7906", "createTime": 1692713804, "range": "7871-7906", "markText": "To say goodbye is to die a little.\n", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 53}, {"bookId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV", "bookmarkId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV_44_9708-10356", "createTime": 1692590009, "range": "9708-10356", "markText": "“The homicide dick who investigated the case is an old friend of mine. He’s a bulldog and a bloodhound and an old wise cop. He doesn’t like a few things. Why did Roger leave no note—when he was a writing fool? Why did he shoot himself in such a way as to leave the shock of discovery to his wife? Why did he bother to pick the moment when I couldn’t hear the gun go off? Why did she forget her house keys so that she had to be let in to the house? Why did she leave him alone on the day the help got off? Remember, she said she didn’t know I would be there. If she did, those two cancel out.”\n", "colorStyle": 0, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 44}, {"bookId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV", "bookmarkId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV_6_7118-7365", "createTime": 1691944807, "range": "7118-7365", "markText": "“They don’t know how to make them here,” he said. “What they call a gimlet is just some lime or lemon juice and gin with a dash of sugar and bitters. A real gimlet is half gin and half Rose’s Lime Juice and nothing else. It beats martinis hollow.”", "colorStyle": 2, "type": 1, "chapterUid": 6}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "TheLongGoodbye", "chapterUid": 53, "chapterIdx": 53}, {"title": "TheLongGoodbye", "chapterUid": 44, "chapterIdx": 44}, {"title": "TheLongGoodbye", "chapterUid": 6, "chapterIdx": 6}], "book": {"bookId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV", "version": 951667504, "format": "epub", "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_3I3FwZFwY7tG6gw6gm0Nm3y3_parsecover", "title": "The Long Goodbye", "author": "Raymond Chandler", "coverBoxInfo": {"colorsPure": ["#93B0DA", "#98B8DD"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7KAyUV1BA", "review": {"bookId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV", "content": "So she has already known Malowe was here, what is she hiding?", "bookVersion": 951667504, "range": "10976-11126", "abstract": "“Candy got the lunch before he left. I guess I’ll blow now. I hope my car wasn’t in your way.”", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 38, "reviewId": "17408780_7KAyUV1BA", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1692451809, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV", "format": "epub", "version": 951667504, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wrepub/CB_3I3FwZFwY7tG6gw6gm0Nm3y3_parsecover", "title": "The Long Goodbye", "author": "Raymond Chandler", "payType": 134217761}, "chapterIdx": 38, "chapterTitle": "TheLongGoodbye", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7KyWnmaPQ", "review": {"bookId": "CB_1KyFr6FrxD6b6iD6gXGniFQV", "content": "OMG, Lenox died for Wade? Wade killed his wife?\n", "bookVersion": 951667504, "range": "7769-7893", "abstract": "A good man died for me once, why, not a cockroach in a white jacket?", "type": 1, "isPrivate": 1, "chapterUid": 31, "reviewId": "17408780_7KyWnmaPQ", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1692359699, "flag": 8, "isLike": 0, "isRepo